# Make a copy of this file named .env (right-click it in Cursor, Copy, Paste, rename)
# and put real values there. .env is gitignored and Claude Code is denied from reading it.
# Only variable names and harmless placeholders belong in this file.
#
# The penguin project needs no secrets. This is the pattern to follow when one does,
# for example if you add an API key later:
EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
